      "derivation": "第一把3/7倒读为7/3>1，正幂误判为>；第二pi>1且指数为负，判为<；第三sqrt(15)<4，底数<1且指数为负，判为>；第四错误以两根都>1为由认定sqrt3-sqrt2>1，负幂误判为<，得到整列>,<,>,<。实际第一<、第四>，所以整列为假。",
      "misconception": "把第一项分数底数倒读，并误以两个大于1的平方根之差仍大于1；中间两项按实际底数范围处理，再分别使用指数符号。"
    },
    "evidence": "The repaired procedure has exactly two stated errors: reverse the first fractional base, and incorrectly classify the final difference of roots as greater than 1. It explicitly handles the middle bases correctly. Positive exponent on the reversed first base produces >; the second base is >1 with a negative exponent and produces <; the third base is <1 with a negative exponent and produces >; the wrongly classified final base is >1 with a negative exponent and produces <. These four steps produce the complete displayed D column, not only a fragment. The correction also identifies the first and fourth entries as the actual errors. This disposes of the previous sign-only-procedure defect without changing any option or correct set.",
